{"at":"2026-10-21T13:50:30.600276Z","event":"agent_commit","task_id":"investigate","role":"solo","output":{"summary":"Starting at ~11:15 UTC the edge‑gateway error rate jumped from ~0.2 % to ~2 % and its p99 latency rose sharply. Gateway logs show thousands of “connection timeout to portfolio‑service” errors. Portfolio‑service logs show a matching burst of gRPC “UNAVAILABLE (connection reset)” failures when calling market‑data‑service, yet market‑data‑service’s own error rate and latency stay at baseline. The only code change in the window is the orders‑service v2.16.0 deploy at 11:05, which correlates with a modest rise in orders‑service error rate but does not explain the gateway timeouts to portfolio‑service. The evidence points to a degradation in the portfolio‑service → market‑data‑service path (likely a transient network or downstream issue) that stalls portfolio‑service, causing gateway timeouts and the observed 2 % error spike.","observations":[{"statement":"edge‑gateway error_rate baseline ≈0.002, spikes to 0.018‑0.023 beginning at 11:15 UTC","artifacts":["metric:edge-gateway/error_rate"],"service":null,"key":"F1"},{"statement":"edge‑gateway latency_p99 rises from ~342 ms baseline to 500‑590 ms starting at 11:15 UTC","artifacts":["metric:edge-gateway/latency_p99_ms"],"service":null,"key":"F2"},{"statement":"orders‑service error_rate baseline ≈0.0018, rises to 0.006‑0.009 from 11:15 UTC","artifacts":["metric:orders-service/error_rate"],"service":null,"key":"F3"},{"statement":"portfolio‑service error_rate remains at baseline (~0.002) throughout the window","artifacts":["metric:portfolio-service/error_rate"],"service":null,"key":"F4"},{"statement":"payments‑service error_rate stays at baseline (~0.002) throughout the window","artifacts":["metric:payments-service/error_rate"],"service":null,"key":"F5"},{"statement":"market‑data‑service error_rate stays at baseline (~0.0019) throughout the window","artifacts":["metric:market-data-service/error_rate"],"service":n